From f73b16a3149879f8200223a29eff33af870531f9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <claude@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 29 Jul 2026 11:51:37 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(settings): public bareme endpoint + exercisesSolved on
 profile
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- New GET /settings/bareme (no auth) exposing only the gamification
  XP economy — direct-answer bonus, hint penalties, forum XP — never
  platform name/support email/maintenance mode, which stay admin-only
- getProfile() now also returns exercisesSolved (correct-attempt
  count), needed for a real 'QCM Expert' badge based on actual
  success rate rather than raw attempt count
- Powers the redesigned Progression screen on the student profile
